        ":question/id": "d51f6d4a-9fe0-500c-90c3-86af5830b753",
        ":question/problem": "What is $\\displaystyle \\int\\sinh (6x - 4)dx$?",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Let $u=6x - 4$. Then $du=6\\,dx$, so $dx=\\frac{1}{6}\\,du$.\n\n$$\n\\int\\sinh (6x - 4)dx = \\frac{1}{6}\\int\\sinh u\\,du = \\frac{1}{6}\\cosh u + C = \\frac{1}{6}\\cosh (6x - 4) + C\n$$",
